# The Network: Cloudflare Tunnel
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# cloudflared dials the Cloudflare edge on 7844 and carries its own transport security. Proxying it adds a hop to every tunnelled service for no benefit.
#
# cfargotunnel.com is the current connector hostname. argotunnel.com is the older name still in use on some agents. trycloudflare.com is the quick-tunnel front.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,argotunnel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cfargotunnel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,trycloudflare.com
